---
---

<section id="centralizacao" class="crm-centralization-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">GESTÃO DE ATENDIMENTO & CRM</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Múltiplos WhatsApps e vendedores <br />
        <span class="highlight">centralizados em uma única tela.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Além da IA atuando de forma automática, sua empresa ganha um CRM completo para a equipe atender manualmente, acompanhar conversas e gerenciar todos os números do negócio.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sticky Stacking Cards Container (Efeito de Scroll com Sobreposição e Desfoque) -->
    <div class="sticky-stack-container">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Múltiplos WhatsApps & Colaboradores -->
      <div class="sticky-feature-card" style="--card-index: 0;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="cf-icon-wrap green-icon">
            <svg class="cf-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="cf-badge">CENTRALIZAÇÃO</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Múltiplos WhatsApps & Colaboradores</h3>
        <p>Conecte o WhatsApp principal da empresa e os números individuais dos seus vendedores e colaboradores. O gestor acompanha todo o histórico sem depender do celular pessoal da equipe.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Regras Personalizadas Por Canal -->
      <div class="sticky-feature-card" style="--card-index: 1;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="cf-icon-wrap purple-icon">
            <svg class="cf-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
              <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="cf-badge purple">REGRAS DE CANAL</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Regras Personalizadas por Número</h3>
        <p>Defina como cada canal vai funcionar: ative a IA no WhatsApp de pré-vendas, coloque um chatbot no suporte e deixe outro número 100% manual para a diretoria.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Unificação de Instagram, TikTok e Website -->
      <div class="sticky-feature-card" style="--card-index: 2;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="cf-icon-wrap blue-icon">
            <svg class="cf-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="cf-badge blue">MULTICANALIDADE</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Unifique Instagram, TikTok e Chat do Site</h3>
        <p>Conecte o Direct do Instagram, TikTok e chat do site na mesma fila de atendimento. Seus vendedores atendem todos os clientes sem precisar trocar de janela.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .crm-centralization-section {
    padding: 90px 0 120px;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #fff;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .shell {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 860px; /* Focused column width for card stacking */
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(118, 89, 239, 0.15);
    color: #a89cf0;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .section-title .highlight {
    color: #4cd9a4;
  }

  .section-desc {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  /* Sticky Stacking Cards Container */
  .sticky-stack-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sticky-feature-card {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(100px + var(--card-index, 0) * 20px);
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 -4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .card-top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .cf-icon-wrap {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .cf-svg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .green-icon { background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.2); color: #00a884; }
  .purple-icon { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); color: #c084fc; }
  .blue-icon { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); color: #60a5fa; }

  .cf-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.15);
    color: #4cd9a4;
  }

  .cf-badge.purple { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); color: #c084fc; }
  .cf-badge.blue { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); color: #60a5fa; }

  .sticky-feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .sticky-feature-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
